    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CBPM Real Estate is delighted to introduce to the market this beautifully presented three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home, ideally positioned in the popular residential development of Ardrew Fields, Dun Brinn, Athy, Co. Kildare.\r\n\r\nPresented in showhouse condition throughout, this impressive property extends to approximately 98.12 m² and offers bright, modern and well-proportioned accommodation. The property is a genuine turn-key home, allowing its new owners to move in and enjoy it from day one.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is complemented by a BER B energy rating and gas central heating, providing a comfortable and energy-efficient home.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features is the impressive rear garden, which has been thoughtfully designed to provide an excellent outdoor living and entertaining space. It incorporates a patio area, pergola and garden sheds, while to the front there is the added convenience of off-street parking.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n3 Bedrooms\r\n3 Bathrooms\r\nSemi-Detached Family Home\r\nApprox. 98.12 m²\r\nBER B\r\nGas Central Heating\r\nShowhouse Condition\r\nTurn-Key Property\r\nImpressive Rear Garden\r\nPatio & Pergola\r\nGarden Sheds\r\nOff-Street Parking\r\nSought-After Residential Location\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys a convenient location within easy reach of Athy town centre, offering access to an excellent range of everyday amenities including supermarkets, shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, childcare facilities and sporting amenities.\r\n\r\nAthy Train Station provides rail connections for commuters, while the town is well connected by road to surrounding areas including Kildare, Newbridge, Portlaoise and Carlow.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families or those looking for a beautifully finished, energy-efficient home requiring no additional work.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the condition, garden and location of this exceptional home."
      },
      {
